{"meta":{"id":"postgresql-query-tuning","category":"it/server/backend/database","title":"PostgreSQL 쿼리 개선","subtitle":"","summary":"실행 계획 기반 개선 — 비정규화 컬럼 UNNEST 조인, 상관 서브쿼리 → 조인, 선집계 후 조인, 형변환은 파라미터 쪽, 집계 전 조건","tags":["postgresql","db","쿼리","성능","mybatis"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"query-tuning","updatedAt":""},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>POSTGRESQL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">PostgreSQL 쿼리 개선</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 실행 계획 기반 개선 — 비정규화 컬럼 UNNEST 조인, 상관 서브쿼리 → 조인, 선집계 후 조인, 형변환은 파라미터 쪽, 집계 전 조건</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">개선 방식 요약</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">방식</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">이름</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">1. 비정규화 컬럼 펼치기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SARGable 조인</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">콤마로 이어 붙인 ID 를 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>= ANY(STRING_TO_ARRAY(...))</code> 로 조인 → CTE 에서 UNNEST 로 펼친 뒤 동등 조인</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2. 상관 서브쿼리 → 조인</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Subquery Unnesting</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">행마다 다시 실행되는 SELECT 절 서브쿼리를 GROUP BY 한 번 + <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE ...)</code> 로 합쳐 LEFT JOIN</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">3. 선집계 후 조인</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Pre-aggregation</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">먼저 GROUP BY 로 줄인 뒤(100만 → 1만 행) 조인</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">4. 형변환은 파라미터 쪽에</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">인덱스 사용 유지</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>col::integer = #{값}</code> 대신 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>col = #{값}::varchar</code></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">5. 집계 전에 조건 걸기</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Predicate Pushdown</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">집계 CTE 의 WHERE 에 대상 상품 조건을 넣어 필요한 것만 집계</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">PostgreSQL 쿼리의 실행 계획(<code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>)을 보고 아래 방식으로 고쳤습니다. 공통 원칙은 <strong>인덱스를 탈 수 있는 형태로 조건을 쓰고, 큰 테이블은 한 번만 · 적게 읽는 것</strong>입니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">1) 비정규화 컬럼 펼치기 (SARGable 조인)</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">콤마로 이어 붙인 ID 컬럼을 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>= ANY(STRING_TO_ARRAY(...))</code> 로 조인하면 인덱스를 쓰지 못합니다. CTE 에서 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>UNNEST</code> 로 먼저 펼친 뒤 동등 조인으로 바꿔 PK 인덱스를 타게 했습니다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-rose-600'>❌ Before</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">SELECT p.*\r\nFROM orders o\r\nJOIN products p\r\n  ON p.product_id = ANY(STRING_TO_ARRAY(o.product_ids, &#x27;,&#x27;)::int[])\r\nWHERE o.order_id = 100;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-emerald-600'>✅ After</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">WITH ids AS (\r\n    SELECT DISTINCT UNNEST(STRING_TO_ARRAY(o.product_ids, &#x27;,&#x27;))::int AS product_id\r\n    FROM orders o\r\n    WHERE o.order_id = 100\r\n)\r\nSELECT p.*\r\nFROM ids\r\nJOIN products p ON p.product_id = ids.product_id;   -- 동등 조인 → PK 인덱스 사용</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">2) 상관 서브쿼리를 조인으로 바꾸기 (Subquery Unnesting)</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">SELECT 절의 상관 서브쿼리는 행마다 다시 실행됩니다. 건수 · 평균 · 본인 작성 여부처럼 같은 테이블을 여러 번 읽던 서브쿼리를 GROUP BY 한 번과 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE ...)</code> 로 합쳐 LEFT JOIN 했습니다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-rose-600'>❌ Before</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- SELECT 절의 상관 서브쿼리: 상품 행마다 reviews 를 3번 읽음\r\nSELECT p.product_id,\r\n       p.name,\r\n       (SELECT COUNT(*)   FROM reviews r WHERE r.product_id = p.product_id) AS review_cnt,\r\n       (SELECT AVG(score) FROM reviews r WHERE r.product_id = p.product_id) AS avg_score,\r\n       CASE WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM reviews r\r\n                         WHERE r.product_id = p.product_id\r\n                           AND r.user_id = &#x27;kim&#x27;)\r\n            THEN &#x27;Y&#x27; ELSE &#x27;N&#x27; END AS my_review_yn\r\nFROM products p;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-emerald-600'>✅ After</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- reviews 를 한 번만 읽어 GROUP BY 후 조인\r\nSELECT p.product_id,\r\n       p.name,\r\n       COALESCE(r.review_cnt, 0) AS review_cnt,\r\n       r.avg_score,\r\n       CASE WHEN r.my_cnt &gt; 0 THEN &#x27;Y&#x27; ELSE &#x27;N&#x27; END AS my_review_yn\r\nFROM products p\r\nLEFT JOIN (\r\n    SELECT product_id,\r\n           COUNT(*)                                AS review_cnt,\r\n           AVG(score)                              AS avg_score,\r\n           COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE user_id = &#x27;kim&#x27;) AS my_cnt\r\n    FROM reviews\r\n    GROUP BY product_id\r\n) r ON r.product_id = p.product_id;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">실제 적용 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>tb_goods_info_manage</code> 의 이용 기간을 행마다 조회하던 서브쿼리도 한 번의 JOIN 으로 바꿨습니다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-rose-600'>❌ Before</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 행마다 서브쿼리 실행\r\n(CAST((SELECT use_term FROM tb_goods_info_manage\r\n       WHERE goods_mng_sn = tog.goods_mng_sn::integer) AS INTEGER) * INTERVAL &#x27;1 DAY&#x27;)</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-emerald-600'>✅ After</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 한 번만 JOIN\r\nJOIN tb_goods_info_manage gim ON gim.goods_mng_sn = tog.goods_mng_sn::integer\r\n... CAST(gim.use_term AS INTEGER) * INTERVAL &#x27;1 DAY&#x27;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">3) 선집계 후 조인 (Pre-aggregation)</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">조인한 다음 집계하면 큰 테이블 전체가 조인에 들어갑니다. 먼저 GROUP BY 로 집계해 100만 행을 상품 수(1만 행) 수준으로 줄인 뒤 조인했습니다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-rose-600'>❌ Before</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 조인한 다음 집계: reviews 전체가 조인에 들어감\r\nSELECT p.product_id, p.name, MAX(r.created_at) AS last_review_dt\r\nFROM products p\r\nJOIN reviews r ON r.product_id = p.product_id\r\nGROUP BY p.product_id, p.name;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-emerald-600'>✅ After</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 집계한 다음 조인\r\nSELECT p.product_id, p.name, r.last_review_dt\r\nFROM products p\r\nJOIN (\r\n    SELECT product_id, MAX(created_at) AS last_review_dt\r\n    FROM reviews\r\n    GROUP BY product_id          -- 100만 행 → 상품 수(1만 행)로 축소\r\n) r ON r.product_id = p.product_id;</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">4) 형변환은 컬럼이 아니라 파라미터 쪽에</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>goods_mng_sn::integer = #{값}</code> 처럼 컬럼을 변환하면 인덱스를 쓰지 못합니다. <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>goods_mng_sn = #{값}::varchar</code> 로 파라미터 쪽을 변환해 인덱스 사용을 유지했습니다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-rose-600'>❌ Before</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 컬럼을 변환 → 인덱스 사용 불가\r\nWHERE like_at = &#x27;Y&#x27;\r\n  AND goods_mng_sn::integer = #{goods_mng_sn}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-emerald-600'>✅ After</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 파라미터를 컬럼 타입(varchar)으로 변환 → 인덱스 사용 유지\r\nWHERE like_at = &#x27;Y&#x27;\r\n  AND goods_mng_sn = #{goods_mng_sn}::varchar</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">5) 집계 전에 조건 걸기</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">좋아요 수 집계 CTE 가 전체 상품을 GROUP BY 한 뒤 필요한 상품만 골라 쓰고 있었습니다. 대상 상품 조건을 집계 전 WHERE 에 넣어 필요한 상품만 집계하도록 바꿨습니다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-rose-600'>❌ Before</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 전체 상품을 GROUP BY 한 뒤 필요한 상품만 골라 씀\r\nSELECT goods_mng_sn::integer, COUNT(*)\r\nFROM tb_goods_like\r\nWHERE like_at = &#x27;Y&#x27;\r\nGROUP BY goods_mng_sn</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><strong class='text-emerald-600'>✅ After</strong></p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">sql</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">-- 대상 상품만 집계\r\nSELECT goods_mng_sn::integer, COUNT(*)\r\nFROM tb_goods_like\r\nWHERE like_at = &#x27;Y&#x27;\r\n  AND goods_mng_sn::integer IN (#{goodsMngSnList...})   -- 대상 상품만\r\nGROUP BY goods_mng_sn</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">※ 여기서도 4) 원칙대로 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>goods_mng_sn IN (...)</code> 에 varchar 값을 넘기면 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>goods_mng_sn</code> 인덱스를 함께 쓸 수 있습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실행 계획에서 볼 곳</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">표시</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의심할 것</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Seq Scan</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">큰 테이블에 인덱스가 있는데도 Seq Scan 이면 → 조인 · WHERE 조건이 컬럼을 감싸고 있지 않은지 (형변환 · 함수 · ANY(배열))</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">SubPlan</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SELECT 절 상관 서브쿼리가 행마다 실행되는 표시 → loops 수만큼 반복. GROUP BY + JOIN 으로 풀기</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">rows (조인 입력)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">조인 · 정렬에 들어가는 행 수가 결과보다 훨씬 많으면 → 먼저 집계하거나 조건을 앞으로</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-sky-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">HashAggregate / GroupAggregate</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">집계 대상 행 수 확인 — 필요 없는 행까지 집계하고 있지 않은지</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">관련 문서</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">MySQL 테이블 · 키 정의는 <strong>프로그램 언어(문법) › MYSQL</strong>, MyBatis 매퍼를 쓰는 Spring 프로젝트는 <strong>IT › 프로젝트 › IoT 데이터 관리 웹</strong> 에 있습니다.</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/backend/database/postgresql-query-tuning","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"backend","title":"백엔드","path":"it/server/backend"},{"id":"database","title":"DB · 쿼리","path":"it/server/backend/database"}],"hasImage":false}